{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EMRmTYjBM91794372218.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔商場大堂驚現老鼠「定格」離奇場面。網上流傳一段片段，有市民在大埔某商場逛街時，赫然發現一隻老鼠趴在大堂路中心當眼處。令人奇異的是，該隻老鼠雖然雙眼睜開，但全程僵硬動也不動，吸引多名途經市民圍觀並舉機拍攝。</p><p><p><img alt=\"897438868_10245625119031720_7769057500997078276_n.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ywxxhsJZom1794372167.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>不少網民指出，涉事商場毗鄰街市，容易滋生鼠患，留言批評：「隔籬就係街市，老鼠天堂」，更有街坊透露該處已非首次出現鼠蹤：「上個月月中都係這個位出現老鼠」。另外，對於老鼠睜眼趴在地上無法移動的異樣狀態，不少網民心生疑問，紛紛留言分析：「受傷了」、「食咗鼠餌？」</p><p><p><img alt=\"899465830_10245625118871716_8091064549077163836_n.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OW0Zafb1ai1794372176.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:12:40.646360+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":233,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T04:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T01:20:25.312370+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T05:06:07.163345+00:00","content_hash":"2e54969c277f92731a5318c9b30729de2d1bcae4f0f386d8142393c4cf20c9ed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:12:40.646360+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}